OpenCut is an independent, clean-room open-source video editor.

It was written after observing the *architecture* of a commercial video editor
(CapCut 15.3.0, package com.lemon.lvoverseas) through static analysis of the
shipped package. See docs/CAPCUT_REVERSE_ENGINEERING.md.

No CapCut source code, resources, artwork, fonts, audio or text are included in
this repository, and none of CapCut's trademarks are used. All names, the logo and
the launcher icon in this project are original artwork created for it.

OpenCut has no connection to CapCut or ByteDance. It does not call their servers,
does not use their APIs, and does not download their effects, filters, templates
or music. See docs/PROVIDERS.md for the optional self-hosted content catalogue.

OpenCut is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any commercial video
editor.

